msgctxt "dialog->code_execution_consent->body_intro"
msgid ""
"Running a fenced snippet starts a real subprocess on your computer using "
"your user privileges. Ferrite does not sandbox runners or filter network "
"access."
msgstr ""
"Running a fenced snippet starts a real subprocess on your கணிப்பொறி, கணிணி "
"using your பயனர் privileges. இரும்பியம் does not sandbox runners or வடிப்பி "
"பிணையம் access."

msgctxt "dialog->code_execution_consent->body_settings_echo"
msgid ""
"Same caveats as in Settings → Editor → Code execution: no sandbox — only use"
" with documents you trust."
msgstr ""
"Same caveats அச் in அமைப்புகள் → திருத்தி → குறியீடு execution: இல்லை "
"sandbox — only use with ஆவணங்கள் you trust."

