msgid "Open https://mermaid.js.org/ in your browser"
msgstr "திற https://mermaid.js.org/ in your browser"

msgctxt "about->mermaid->snippet_label"
msgid "Starter snippet (matches Insert → Mermaid…)"
msgstr "Starter snippet (matches செருகவும் → Mermaid…)"

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->flowchart"
msgid ""
"Flowcharts draw nodes and arrows—processes, decisions, and styled shapes. "
"Try Top-Down (TD), Left-Right (LR), and `style` / `classDef` for colors."
msgstr ""
"Flowcharts draw nodes and arrows—processes, decisions, and styled shapes. "
"Try Top-Down (TD), Left-Right (LR), and `style` / `classDef` க்கு colors."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->sequence"
msgid ""
"Sequence diagrams show actors as lifelines and messages over time (`->`, "
"`->>`, `-->>`)."
msgstr ""
"வரிசை diagrams காட்டு actors அச் lifelines and செய்திகள் வீச்சலகு time "
"(`->`, `->>`, `-->>`)."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->state"
msgid ""
"State diagrams describe states and transitions; `stateDiagram-v2` is the "
"modern syntax."
msgstr ""
"State diagrams describe states and transitions; `stateDiagram-v2` is the "
"modern syntax."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->class"
msgid ""
"Class diagrams model types and relationships such as inheritance and "
"associations."
msgstr ""
"வகுப்பு diagrams மாதிரியுரு வகைகள் and relationships such அச் பரம்பரை and "
"associations."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->er"
msgid ""
"Entity–relationship diagrams declare entities and cardinalities (`||--o{`, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Entity–relationship diagrams declare நிறுவனங்கள் and cardinalities "
"(`||--o{`, etc.)."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->pie"
msgid "Pie charts visualize shares of a whole from labeled numeric slices."
msgstr ""
"Pie விளக்கப்படங்கள் visualize பங்குகள் of a whole இருந்து labeled எண் வரிசை "
"slices."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->gantt"
msgid "Gantt charts lay out tasks on a time axis with sections and durations."
msgstr ""
"Gantt விளக்கப்படங்கள் lay out பணிகள் on a time axis with பிரிவுகள் and "
"durations."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->journey"
msgid "User journey maps score steps inside sections for users or actors."
msgstr ""
"பயனர் journey maps கெலிப்பெண் படிகள் inside பிரிவுகள் க்கு பயனர்கள் or "
"actors."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->mindmap"
msgid "Mindmaps branch topics radially from a central root."
msgstr "Mindmaps branch topics radially இருந்து a மைய root."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->timeline"
msgid "Timelines list dated titles along a horizontal axis."
msgstr "Timelines பட்டியல் dated titles along a horizontal axis."

msgctxt "about->mermaid->types->gitgraph"
msgid "Git graph shows commits and branches in a linearized history view."
msgstr "Git graph shows commits and branches in a linearized வரலாறு view."

